ht. It began with natural gas compression in the 1990s and has added gas dehydration, drilling and workover rigs, integrated project management, charter hire of entire gas processing facilities, offshore support services and, most recently, production enhancement of mature fields. Its customers are major oil and gas producers, public sector undertakings, private sector companies and multinationals, and it states it caters to the …","certs":"","co":"DEEP INDUSTRIES LIMITED","depth":"deep","end_markets":"Major oil and gas producers|Public sector undertakings (ONGC named as the production-enhancement counterparty)|Private sector E&P companies|Multinational companies|India - operations across 8 states; contracts executed in deserts, eco-sensitive areas and mountain-range terrain|Middle East - served through subsidiary Deep International DMCC, which acquired gas compression packages in the USA for these opportunities|Kuwait - approved drilling contractor with Kuwait Oil Company|Offshore oil & gas, offshore wind, deep-sea mining, undersea data cables and undersea pipelines/power cables are named …","expansion":"Deep Industries expands mainly by adding owned, mobile service assets that are then let on charter hire, rather than by building plants. The MD&A describes an owned fleet of 20 onshore rigs - 14 workover rigs of 30T to 150T and 6 drilling rigs of 1000 Hp - deployable across deserts, eco-sensitive areas and mountain terrain, and gas dehydration units commissioned at capacities of up to 10 LSCMD on a Build-Own-Operate basis. Project Jaya is described as the first project where the entire gas processing and produced-fluid network from wellhead to the transportation point was delivered on a …","grades":{"rel":0,"s":"","wm90":null},"industry":"Oil","isin":"INE0FHS01024","kpi":null,"listed_on":"","litigation":null,"mdna":"Management frames the Indian oil & gas sector as undergoing a structural rebalancing, with the Government accelerating its resolve to reduce import dependence amid global supply-side disruptions|Government targeting a USD 500 billion energy infrastructure opportunity by 2030 with heavy emphasis on domestic exploration and production, under the Aatmanirbhar Bharat vision|Shift by PSUs from captive to outsourced oil and gas support services is explicitly called out as an opportunity for Deep|Rising market demand for gas compression services and an increasing trend of outsourcing that …","objects":null,"oem":"","one_liner":"Deep Industries is a one-stop oil-and-gas support-services provider of over 30 years' standing that describes itself as India's only integrated onshore and offshore oil & gas service provider, covering more than 70% of post-exploration value-chain services largely on a charter-hire basis.","peer_panel":{"asof":"2026-08-14","industry":"Oil","peers":[{"ebitda_margin":62.2,"fy":"FY26","growth_basis":"YoY","mcap":1777,"name":"DOLPHIN OFF ENT (IND) L","pat":68.5,"pat_growth":47.5,"pe":25.9,"rev":116.4,"rev_growth":324.3,"s":"DOLPHIN","source":"product","why":"shares diving/management/offshore/services"},{"ebitda_margin":35.0,"fy":"FY26","growth_basis":"7y CAGR","mcap":1571,"name":"JINDAL DRILLING & INDUSTRIES LTD","pat":210.6,"pat_growth":17.5,"pe":7.5,"rev":996.6,"rev_growth":25.1,"s":"JINDRILL","source":"product","why":"shares drilling/offshore/services"},{"ebitda_margin":35.8,"fy":"FY26","growth_basis":"","mcap":1251,"name":"GUJARAT NATURAL RES L","pat":9.9,"pat_growth":null,"pe":126.4,"rev":30.5,"rev_growth":null,"s":"GNRL","source":"product","why":"shares management/production/project/services"},{"ebitda_margin":15.6,"fy":"FY26","growth_basis":"7y CAGR","mcap":350927,"name":"OIL AND NATURAL GAS CORP.","pat":49793.1,"pat_growth":7.2,"pe":7.0,"rev":662247.3,"rev_growth":5.6,"s":"ONGC","source":"industry","why":"same industry (Oil)"},{"ebitda_margin":30.8,"fy":"FY26","growth_basis":"7y CAGR","mcap":78809,"name":"OIL INDIA LTD","pat":7550.7,"pat_growth":12.9,"pe":10.4,"rev":33946.1,"rev_growth":13.7,"